 nights stay at a hotel all of  which are fake to his wrists is chained  a briefcase containing false documents  alluding to an invasion of Greece and  Sardinia within those fake plans are  hints that the Allies would attempt a  mincemeat style act of deception where  the Germans would be tricked into  thinking the attack would come in Sicily  which is actually where the real one  will take place in his Royal Marines  uniform major Martin is placed in his  steel canister filled with dry ice  driven to holy Loch Scotland by Aston  Martin race car driver John horse fall  and load  it onto the submarine hms sarah at 4:30  a.m. on April 30th its surface off the  coast of 12a Spain where a known German  agent was stationed major Martin was  fitted with a life jacket red navel  burial rites and pushed into the sea in  time his body would be found turned over  to the Germans who would take the bait  divert their armies from Italy as well  as from the Eastern Front  an unforeseen response to the ruse that  had even greater effect on sealing the  fate of the enemy and the course of the  war  [Music]
 

